    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "You try to create illusory terrors in others’ minds. Each creature of your choice in a 30-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 10d10 Psychic damage and has the Frightened condition for the duration. On a successful save, a target takes half as much damage only.",
        "A Frightened target makes a Wisdom saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a failed save, it takes 5d10 Psychic damage. On a successful save, the spell ends on that target."
      ],
      "html": "<div> <p>You try to create illusory terrors in others’ minds. Each creature of your choice in a 30-foot-radius <a>Sphere</a> centered on a point within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 10d10 Psychic damage and has the <a>Frightened</a> condition for the duration. On a successful save, a target takes half as much damage only.</p> <p>A Frightened target makes a Wisdom saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a failed save, it takes 5d10 Psychic damage. On a successful save, the spell ends on that target.</p> </div>",
      "type": "description"
